                                <th style="border: solid black; text-align: center;">Mark As Done</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border: solid black;" rowspan="8">QC/RND</td>
                                <td style="border: solid black;">Visual Inspection of any damage of product</td>
                                <td style="border: solid black; text-align: center;">☐</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="border: solid black;">Ensure the no. of products in Packing list matches the physical quantity</td>
                                <td style="border: solid black; text-align: center;">☐</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="border: solid black;">Ensure the Product accessories are complete as per mentioned on the box sticker</td>
                                <td style="border: solid black; text-align: center;">☐</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td style="border: solid black;">Ensure that the packing box is not damaged</td>
                                <td style="border: solid black; text-align: center;">☐</td>
